WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.141 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.035
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:04.737
We've missed you all
a great deal.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.238
Let's get to the news.

00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:08.575
Well, last night was
the closing ceremony

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.610
for the 2020 Tokyo Olympics,

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.913
which, because of COVID,
were actually held in 2021,

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:18.117
which means it's only three more
years until the 2024 Olympics

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.886
are postponed to 2027.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.888
[ Laughter ]
The 2020 Tokyo Olympics

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:25.291
ended yesterday
and U.S. athletes brought home

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:29.094
39 gold medals,
41 silvers, 33 bronze,

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:31.764
and four new variants.

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:33.466
[ Laughter ]
President Biden on Saturday

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.968
held a Zoom call
with Team USA Olympians

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.704
and, if you thought winning
a gold medal was tough,

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:42.508
try explaining to a 78-year-old
man that he's muted.

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:45.778
"No, Mr. President.
I know you can hear me.

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:48.114
I-I can't hear you."

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.649
The United Nations
today released

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.117
a new report on climate change

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:55.054
and I don't want to say it's
bad, but this was the cover.

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:57.023
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.558
President Biden announced
a new goal last week

00:00:59.558 --> 00:01:02.862
that half of all vehicles sold
in the country by 2030

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.964
should be electric and,
for some reason,

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:08.000
the other half should be
vintage Stingrays.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.469
[ Laughter ]
[ As Biden ]
Everything's heating up,

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:11.004
so you got to keep it cool.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:13.006
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:14.674
The Rolling Stones
recently announced

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.509
they'll go back on tour
in September,

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:19.745
after it was put on hold
last year due to the pandemic.

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:23.416
It's actually the second time
it's happened to them.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.684
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.684 --> 00:01:27.553
Disney World last week
unveiled designs

00:01:27.553 --> 00:01:30.723
for its new "Star Wars"-themed
hotel that will open next year

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:33.259
and feature
an immersive experience.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:36.028
Though, if you're a fan
of Disney and "Star Wars,"

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:39.665
the only thing you haven't been
immersed in is society.

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:41.267
[ Laughter ]
The makers of Crocs

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.601
recently filed lawsuits,

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:44.903
against Walmart
and nearly 20 other companies,

00:01:44.903 --> 00:01:47.306
that claims they copied
their popular shoe style.

00:01:47.306 --> 00:01:48.507
Said Walmart,

00:01:48.507 --> 00:01:50.310
"That's a pasta strainer."

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.611
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:54.847
And, finally, the ice cream
company Marble Slab

00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:57.750
recently announced a new
collaboration with Frito-Lay

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.252
to create a Hot Cheetos-flavored
ice cream.

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:03.155
Well, technically, it was also
a collaboration with weed.

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:05.758
[ Laughter ]
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:08.628
And, Marble Slab,
if you're watching,

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.863
"Seth Meyers Ice Cream"
still available.

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:12.732
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:16.002
No movement at all from our
friends at Ben &amp; Jerry's.

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.070
[ Laughter ]

